Local modifications
-------------------
The following files were modified from upstream. Each carries a
`# MODIFIED from upstream gamescomputersplay/monopoly @ 7c4df31:` header at the
top describing the change:

    monopoly/core/board.py     Board.from_config / _apply_config,
                               _recompute_landmarks, cell_index_by_name,
                               next_cell_of_group, variable-length board support.
    monopoly/core/game.py      monopoly_game_from_config / setup_game_from_config /
                               setup_players_from_config (GameConfig-driven play).
    monopoly/core/player.py    dynamic board length + landmark indices for boards
                               shorter than 40 cells; _should_buy /
                               _improve_cash_floor hooks.
    monopoly/analytics.py      AnalyzerFromConfig (players from GameConfig +
                               SimulationSettings).
    settings.py                config-injection hooks (top-level glue module).

All other files under `monopoly/` are unmodified from the vendored commit.
